Package: unmasked
Title: Unmasking the Data: Exploring Data with R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bella", "Luzak", , "Bella.Luzak@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The package unmasked provides a way to make data exploration, summarization, and visualization easier and more approachable. By combining workflow moves and functions to calculate group percentages and organize the data, unmasked helps to uncover patterns in the data and clearly communicate the findings.
